<c.simplifiedchinese>他们并没有白白送死</c.simplifiedchinese>

115
00:08:05.610 --> 00:08:07.653 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>御庭番众四人的性命</c.simplifiedchinese>

116
00:08:08.488 --> 00:08:11.324 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>打败了你的加特林机枪</c.simplifiedchinese>

117
00:08:12.575 --> 00:08:14.160 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>放…放过我</c.simplifiedchinese>

118
00:08:14.243 --> 00:08:18.122 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>想要求情的话
不如拜托你崇拜的“金钱”去吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

119
00:08:20.625 --> 00:08:21.959 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>救…</c.simplifiedchinese>

120
00:08:22.043 --> 00:08:24.170 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我…</c.simplifiedchinese>

121
00:08:24.253 --> 00:08:29.008 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真不愧是剑心
就算再生气 说不杀人就不杀</c.simplifiedchinese>

122
00:08:33.262 --> 00:08:36.349 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>暂时让他一个人静静吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

123
00:08:36.432 --> 00:08:37.725 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

124
00:08:38.476 --> 00:08:39.977 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

125
00:08:40.061 --> 00:08:40.895 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下没事</c.simplifiedchinese>

126
00:08:41.687 --> 00:08:43.856 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>只是一下没站稳</c.simplifiedchinese>

127
00:08:44.524 --> 00:08:47.068 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>快走吧 惠小姐还在等我们</c.simplifiedchinese>

128
00:08:47.151 --> 00:08:48.361 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯…</c.simplifiedchinese>

129
00:08:49.946 --> 00:08:51.822 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>四乃森苍紫…</c.simplifiedchinese>

130
00:08:51.906 --> 00:08:55.576 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>让剑心受了这么重的伤
真是了不起的实力</c.simplifiedchinese>

131
00:08:57.078 --> 00:08:59.539 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但这场战斗中</c.simplifiedchinese>

132
00:08:59.622 --> 00:09:04.418 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你受的伤显然更重…</c.simplifiedchinese>

133
00:09:15.638 --> 00:09:18.558 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>枪声停了…到底怎么回事…</c.simplifiedchinese>

134
00:09:23.354 --> 00:09:25.565 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>烦死人了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

135
00:09:27.275 --> 00:09:29.402 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>很好 没有埋伏</c.simplifiedchinese>

136
00:09:29.485 --> 00:09:31.821 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦 左之助</c.simplifiedchinese>

137
00:09:32.405 --> 00:09:34.198 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>抱歉让你久等了</c.simplifiedchinese>

138
00:09:34.282 --> 00:09:36.742 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿剑…你受伤了</c.simplifiedchinese>

139
00:09:36.826 --> 00:09:40.413 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯 我们遇到了一点小麻烦</c.simplifiedchinese>

140
00:09:40.496 --> 00:09:41.372 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>比起这个</c.simplifiedchinese>

141
00:09:41.455 --> 00:09:45.293 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>惠小姐平安无事真是太好了</c.simplifiedchinese>

142
00:09:45.960 --> 00:09:47.336 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对不起</c.simplifiedchinese>

143
00:09:48.462 --> 00:09:50.965 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>把你们牵涉进来</c.simplifiedchinese>

144
00:09:51.048 --> 00:09:53.301 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>还让你们面临这样的危险</c.simplifiedchinese>

145
00:09:54.093 --> 00:09:55.761 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过别担心</c.simplifiedchinese>

146
00:09:56.345 --> 00:09:59.348 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一切的罪魁祸首马上就要消失了</c.simplifiedchinese>

147
00:09:59.432 --> 00:10:00.808 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>惠小姐！</c.simplifiedchinese>

148
00:10:00.891 --> 00:10:06.022 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然一心想见家人让我撑到了今天…</c.simplifiedchinese>

149
00:10:06.105 --> 00:10:11.694 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但生命的最后一刻能见到你们
我真的很高兴</c.simplifiedchinese>

150
00:10:11.777 --> 00:10:14.113 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-等一下！
-谢谢</c.simplifiedchinese>

151
00:10:19.452 --> 00:10:21.287 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这傻女人！</c.simplifiedchinese>

152
00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:25.958 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心和弥彦冒着生命危险来救你</c.simplifiedchinese>

153
00:10:26.042 --> 00:10:28.210 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你想让他们的努力全都白费吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

154
00:10:28.294 --> 00:10:29.420 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

155
00:10:31.756 --> 00:10:33.966 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我又有什么办法呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

156
00:10:34.592 --> 00:10:38.846 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我做的鸦片给那么多人带来痛苦</c.simplifiedchinese>

157
00:10:38.929 --> 00:10:42.808 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不能一个人逃避惩罚</c.simplifiedchinese>

158
00:10:46.103 --> 00:10:47.813 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心 不好！</c.simplifiedchinese>

159
00:10:47.897 --> 00:10:49.273 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>警察来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

160
00:10:49.357 --> 00:10:51.484 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们肯定听到了打斗声</c.simplifiedchinese>

161
00:10:51.567 --> 00:10:53.444 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们得赶紧离开这里</c.simplifiedchinese>

162
00:10:54.362 --> 00:10:55.655 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好了 别在那里傻坐着</c.simplifiedchinese>

163
00:10:56.739 --> 00:10:57.948 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂！</c.simplifiedchinese>

164
00:10:58.032 --> 00:10:59.116 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

165
00:10:59.742 --> 00:11:01.702 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是我家传的金创药</c.simplifiedchinese>

166
00:11:01.786 --> 00:11:06.540 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你胸前的伤先用它来暂时止血
然后尽快去看医生</c.simplifiedchinese>

167
00:11:07.124 --> 00:11:10.920 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>观柳在屋顶开辟了一条秘密通道</c.simplifiedchinese>

168
00:11:11.003 --> 00:11:13.422 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你从那里可以安全离开</c.simplifiedchinese>

169
00:11:13.923 --> 00:11:15.257 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>谢谢你为我做的一切</c.simplifiedchinese>

170
00:11:18.052 --> 00:11:19.845 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>私造鸦片要受死刑</c.simplifiedchinese>

171
00:11:21.889 --> 00:11:24.392 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你知道但还是要去吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

172
00:11:24.475 --> 00:11:25.768 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是</c.simplifiedchinese>

173
00:11:25.851 --> 00:11:28.896 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我做的鸦片害死了人</c.simplifiedchinese>

174
00:11:28.979 --> 00:11:31.023 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不能逃避</c.simplifiedchinese>

175
00:11:38.447 --> 00:11:41.492 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>局长 地下发现了一座秘密仓库</c.simplifiedchinese>

176
00:11:41.575 --> 00:11:43.452 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好 调查一下</c.simplifiedchinese>

177
00:11:43.536 --> 00:11:47.206 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然我们一直在进行秘密调查</c.simplifiedchinese>

178
00:11:47.289 --> 00:11:50.918 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但真是想不到
这里竟然藏着一把加特林机枪</c.simplifiedchinese>

179
00:11:52.086 --> 00:11:53.629 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你是？</c.simplifiedchinese>

180
00:11:55.881 --> 00:11:57.341 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>就是她！</c.simplifiedchinese>

181
00:11:57.425 --> 00:12:00.469 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>她就是生产新型鸦片的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

182
00:12:00.553 --> 00:12:03.055 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>她是我的同伙</c.simplifiedchinese>

183
00:12:03.139 --> 00:12:05.141 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别想找借口 惠</c.simplifiedchinese>

184
00:12:05.224 --> 00:12:08.936 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不论你怎么说 做鸦片的都是你！</c.simplifiedchinese>

185
00:12:09.019 --> 00:12:11.897 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你要跟我一起下地狱！</c.simplifiedchinese>

186
00:12:13.107 --> 00:12:14.358 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真的吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

187
00:12:15.317 --> 00:12:17.319 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-是…
-不 不是</c.simplifiedchinese>

188
00:12:17.403 --> 00:12:18.487 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>绯村先生！</c.simplifiedchinese>

189
00:12:20.448 --> 00:12:23.325 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>她是一位优秀的未来医生</c.simplifiedchinese>

190
00:12:23.409 --> 00:12:27.580 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>只是那家伙为了造鸦片盯上她罢了</c.simplifiedchinese>

191
00:12:27.663 --> 00:12:30.666 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别撒谎了 拔刀斋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

192
00:12:31.250 --> 00:12:32.793 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这家伙闭嘴</c.simplifiedchinese>

193
00:12:33.836 --> 00:12:35.838 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>拔刀斋？</c.simplifiedchinese>

194
00:12:35.921 --> 00:12:38.674 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我说的对吧 弥彦？</c.simplifiedchinese>

195
00:12:38.757 --> 00:12:40.050 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没错</c.simplifiedchinese>

196
00:12:40.134 --> 00:12:42.428 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我是东京武士族明神弥彦</c.simplifiedchinese>

197
00:12:42.511 --> 00:12:46.932 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>再怎么说
我也绝不会为私造鸦片的人而战</c.simplifiedchinese>

198
00:12:47.016 --> 00:12:48.559 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿左 你说呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

199
00:12:48.642 --> 00:12:52.771 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不知道 我只是陪人过来打架的</c.simplifiedchinese>

200
00:12:52.855 --> 00:12:55.691 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>就是这么回事 局长你说呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

201
00:12:56.859 --> 00:12:57.818 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>太牵强吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

202
00:12:59.778 --> 00:13:01.489 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>明白了</c.simplifiedchinese>

203
00:13:01.572 --> 00:13:04.825 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们改天会进行彻底调查</c.simplifiedchinese>

204
00:13:05.409 --> 00:13:09.079 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>今天这位姑娘就先拜托您照顾了</c.simplifiedchinese>

205
00:13:09.163 --> 00:13:10.539 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

206
00:13:10.623 --> 00:13:12.333 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>她是我的同伙</c.simplifiedchinese>

207
00:13:12.416 --> 00:13:13.542 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>只要查查就…</c.simplifiedchinese>

208
00:13:13.626 --> 00:13:16.462 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-够了！赶紧把他带走！
-是</c.simplifiedchinese>

209
00:13:16.545 --> 00:13:18.506 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>可恶 你们偏袒她！</c.simplifiedchinese>

210
00:13:20.299 --> 00:13:21.967 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别碰它</c.simplifiedchinese>

211
00:13:22.051 --> 00:13:24.386 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那是我的加特林机枪！</c.simplifiedchinese>

212
00:13:24.470 --> 00:13:26.597 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不要用你的脏手摸它！</c.simplifiedchinese>

213
00:13:26.680 --> 00:13:27.556 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>赶紧带走！</c.simplifiedchinese>

214
00:13:27.640 --> 00:13:30.559 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>加特！</c.simplifiedchinese>

215
00:13:31.268 --> 00:13:33.938 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>偶尔撒个谎也无妨…</c.simplifiedchinese>

216
00:13:34.021 --> 00:13:36.023 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>只能偶尔而已哦</c.simplifiedchinese>

217
00:13:36.106 --> 00:13:38.984 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿剑…你到底是什么人…</c.simplifiedchinese>

218
00:13:39.068 --> 00:13:41.529 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>“杀人偿命”</c.simplifiedchinese>

219
00:13:42.821 --> 00:13:44.990 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是一种赎罪的方式</c.simplifiedchinese>

220
00:13:45.074 --> 00:13:49.370 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但就算以命相抵
那些死去的人也没法再活过来</c.simplifiedchinese>

221
00:13:49.954 --> 00:13:51.038 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>与其如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

222
00:13:51.121 --> 00:13:54.083 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>挥舞刀剑去保护更多的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

223
00:13:54.166 --> 00:13:56.669 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>才是真正的赎罪</c.simplifiedchinese>

224
00:13:57.753 --> 00:14:01.799 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在的刽子手拔刀斋就是这样生活的</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:14:01.882 --> 00:14:03.801 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>刽子手拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:14:03.884 --> 00:14:05.636 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那位传说中的…</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:14:05.719 --> 00:14:07.805 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>高荷家的精湛医术</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:14:07.888 --> 00:14:11.976 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>比起拔刀斋的剑应该能拯救更多人</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:14:12.977 --> 00:14:15.688 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>去做医生吧 惠小姐</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:14:16.647 --> 00:14:18.774 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不仅为了鸦片的受害者</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:14:18.857 --> 00:14:22.653 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>还要为饱受其他病痛之苦的人出力</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:14:23.279 --> 00:14:26.240 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>要是这样 我朋友的事我就原谅你了</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:14:26.323 --> 00:14:29.118 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样你总有一天可以见到你的家人！</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:14:29.702 --> 00:14:30.870 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>回家吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:14:30.953 --> 00:14:32.955 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰小姐还在家里等我们</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:14:35.666 --> 00:14:37.001 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:14:38.127 --> 00:14:39.628 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>局长</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:14:39.712 --> 00:14:42.339 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>关于苍紫的事…</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:14:42.423 --> 00:14:45.301 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>苍紫？那是谁？</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:14:45.384 --> 00:14:49.096 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>穿着大衣的高个子…</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:14:49.179 --> 00:14:50.848 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没发现这样的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:14:50.931 --> 00:14:55.311 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们赶到时 舞厅里只有武田观柳</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:14:55.394 --> 00:14:59.356 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>还有就是四具无头尸体</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:15:00.316 --> 00:15:01.775 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>苍紫</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:15:01.859 --> 00:15:02.985 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不见了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:15:03.068 --> 00:15:05.321 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这里没有窗</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:15:05.404 --> 00:15:08.157 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他一定是从门离开的</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:15:08.240 --> 00:15:10.784 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们已经封锁所有出口</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:15:10.868 --> 00:15:13.996 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>有人出去我们不可能没注意到</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:15:14.079 --> 00:15:17.333 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不 还有其他出口</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:15:18.000 --> 00:15:19.543 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>观柳的密道</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:15:20.127 --> 00:15:21.378 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>密道的出口在哪？</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:15:21.462 --> 00:15:23.297 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在森林里</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:15:23.380 --> 00:15:25.007 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我来带路</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:15:26.717 --> 00:15:28.344 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>门开着</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:15:28.427 --> 00:15:30.554 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他果然是从这里离开的</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:15:30.638 --> 00:15:31.764 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>搜！</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:15:31.847 --> 00:15:33.307 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他应该还在附近！</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:15:33.390 --> 00:15:34.808 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>苍紫…</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:15:52.660 --> 00:15:54.203 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>愣着干什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:15:54.286 --> 00:15:56.288 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>快抓住他！</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:15:56.372 --> 00:15:59.124 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别过去 过去只会送死</c.simplifiedchinese>

263
00:16:00.626 --> 00:16:02.211 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这不是你的错</c.simplifiedchinese>

264
00:16:02.294 --> 00:16:05.714 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们是为了救你而死</c.simplifiedchinese>

265
00:16:05.798 --> 00:16:08.676 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但他们并不希望你怀着仇恨</c.simplifiedchinese>

266
00:16:08.759 --> 00:16:09.677 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>苍紫</c.simplifiedchinese>

267
00:16:10.260 --> 00:16:12.054 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>再和在下交一次手吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

268
00:16:13.597 --> 00:16:15.849 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在战斗中打败在下</c.simplifiedchinese>

269
00:16:15.933 --> 00:16:19.269 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>把“最强”称号
刻在他们四人的墓碑上</c.simplifiedchinese>

270
00:16:23.232 --> 00:16:24.358 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

271
00:16:25.317 --> 00:16:29.321 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在我杀了你之前 别被其他人杀了</c.simplifiedchinese>

272
00:16:30.864 --> 00:16:32.616 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他跑了 追！</c.simplifiedchinese>

273
00:16:35.869 --> 00:16:37.121 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

274
00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:40.416 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样就好</c.simplifiedchinese>

275
00:16:40.499 --> 00:16:43.168 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在安慰的话对他没用</c.simplifiedchinese>

276
00:16:43.252 --> 00:16:47.131 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是这样他会一直追杀你的</c.simplifiedchinese>

277
00:16:47.214 --> 00:16:50.134 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没事的</c.simplifiedchinese>

278
00:16:51.385 --> 00:16:54.263 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好了 这一次我们真的回家吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

279
00:16:57.558 --> 00:16:59.435 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你回来了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

280
00:16:59.518 --> 00:17:00.644 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们回来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

281
00:17:00.728 --> 00:17:03.772 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过你真的浑身是伤啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

282
00:17:03.856 --> 00:17:06.191 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰小姐 你的手指也…</c.simplifiedchinese>

283
00:17:06.275 --> 00:17:09.111 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个嘛 总而言之 你们辛苦了</c.simplifiedchinese>

284
00:17:09.194 --> 00:17:11.780 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>早饭和热水已经准备好了</c.simplifiedchinese>

285
00:17:11.864 --> 00:17:13.282 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>快吃饭吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

286
00:17:13.365 --> 00:17:15.492 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我累了 先去睡了</c.simplifiedchinese>

287
00:17:15.576 --> 00:17:17.494 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我也是</c.simplifiedchinese>

288
00:17:18.787 --> 00:17:22.124 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我辛辛苦苦为你们做的早饭！</c.simplifiedchinese>

289
00:17:22.207 --> 00:17:23.459 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然但是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

290
00:17:23.542 --> 00:17:24.418 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好困…</c.simplifiedchinese>

291
00:17:24.501 --> 00:17:26.795 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下会好好品尝的</c.simplifiedchinese>

292
00:17:26.879 --> 00:17:28.005 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我…</c.simplifiedchinese>

293
00:17:29.048 --> 00:17:32.051 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>也可以一起吃吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

294
00:17:34.553 --> 00:17:35.929 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-当然
-当然</c.simplifiedchinese>

295
00:18:05.042 --> 00:18:06.710 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好难吃…</c.simplifiedchinese>

296
00:18:13.926 --> 00:18:16.220 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真的麻烦你了</c.simplifiedchinese>

297
00:18:16.303 --> 00:18:17.679 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对不起啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

298
00:18:17.763 --> 00:18:21.642 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我家地方有限
没法再多容纳一个食客</c.simplifiedchinese>

299
00:18:21.725 --> 00:18:25.687 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>而且总有某人天天来蹭饭</c.simplifiedchinese>

300
00:18:25.771 --> 00:18:27.397 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没关系</c.simplifiedchinese>

301
00:18:27.481 --> 00:18:30.984 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你给我介绍了一份包住的工作
真是感激不尽</c.simplifiedchinese>

302
00:18:31.068 --> 00:18:35.114 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>玄斋大夫愿意收下她 真是帮大忙了</c.simplifiedchinese>

303
00:18:35.197 --> 00:18:40.202 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>哎呀 小惠这样的助手
我什么时候都热烈欢迎</c.simplifiedchinese>

304
00:18:40.285 --> 00:18:42.204 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个…阿剑…</c.simplifiedchinese>

305
00:18:42.287 --> 00:18:43.163 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦啰？</c.simplifiedchinese>

306
00:18:43.247 --> 00:18:46.333 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你什么时候厌倦了薰要告诉我哟</c.simplifiedchinese>

307
00:18:46.416 --> 00:18:49.169 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你不嫌弃的话
我随时都愿意做你的对象</c.simplifiedchinese>

308
00:18:50.212 --> 00:18:51.588 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么对象？</c.simplifiedchinese>

309
00:18:51.672 --> 00:18:54.299 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>赶紧给我走 狐狸精！</c.simplifiedchinese>

310
00:18:56.969 --> 00:18:58.846 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我告诉过你</c.simplifiedchinese>

311
00:18:58.929 --> 00:19:02.474 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>小姑娘太天真了 别乱开玩笑逗她</c.simplifiedchinese>

312
00:19:02.558 --> 00:19:05.310 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>哎呀 我可是认真的</c.simplifiedchinese>

313
00:19:05.394 --> 00:19:08.438 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果我对你说这些话 那才是开玩笑</c.simplifiedchinese>

314
00:19:08.522 --> 00:19:10.357 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你想打架吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

315
00:19:10.941 --> 00:19:12.860 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别吃醋呀</c.simplifiedchinese>

316
00:19:12.943 --> 00:19:17.072 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>等你和阿剑一样有男子气概时
我倒可以考虑一下你</c.simplifiedchinese>

317
00:19:17.156 --> 00:19:18.824 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

318
00:19:18.907 --> 00:19:23.287 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我以为经过这次事件
你会有所改变 看来根本没有</c.simplifiedchinese>

319
00:19:23.370 --> 00:19:25.164 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>傻瓜</c.simplifiedchinese>

320
00:19:25.247 --> 00:19:30.002 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我都22岁了
现在想改变我的性格也太晚了</c.simplifiedchinese>

321
00:19:30.085 --> 00:19:34.464 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么感觉这台词好耳熟？</c.simplifiedchinese>

322
00:19:34.548 --> 00:19:37.426 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>最后鸦片的案子怎样了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

323
00:19:37.509 --> 00:19:38.218 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>（狐狸精禁止入内）</c.simplifiedchinese>

324
00:19:38.302 --> 00:19:41.930 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>双方同意让她作为案子的证人</c.simplifiedchinese>

325
00:19:42.014 --> 00:19:43.473 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>可是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

326
00:19:44.892 --> 00:19:48.687 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>苍紫那家伙还是下落不明</c.simplifiedchinese>

327
00:19:48.770 --> 00:19:52.065 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你把自己的性命当作靶子</c.simplifiedchinese>

328
00:19:52.149 --> 00:19:55.194 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>给了苍紫一个活下去的意义…</c.simplifiedchinese>

329
00:19:55.277 --> 00:19:57.070 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他会养好伤</c.simplifiedchinese>

330
00:19:57.154 --> 00:20:01.825 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不断积攒实力
直到有把握和自信赢过在下</c.simplifiedchinese>

331
00:20:01.909 --> 00:20:04.578 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>下次胜负如何还不一定</c.simplifiedchinese>

332
00:20:04.661 --> 00:20:06.205 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你说的什么话！</c.simplifiedchinese>

333
00:20:06.288 --> 00:20:09.041 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心你怎么可能输！</c.simplifiedchinese>

334
00:20:11.668 --> 00:20:12.753 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>话说回来 阿左</c.simplifiedchinese>

335
00:20:12.836 --> 00:20:16.465 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你和式尉聊过什么吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

336
00:20:16.548 --> 00:20:18.634 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？我也不知道</c.simplifiedchinese>

337
00:20:18.717 --> 00:20:21.220 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在观柳的大宅…</c.simplifiedchinese>

338
00:20:22.512 --> 00:20:25.849 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个鸡冠头很有潜力</c.simplifiedchinese>

339
00:20:25.933 --> 00:20:27.434 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>照顾好他</c.simplifiedchinese>

340
